#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:2
msgid "组织一次研究"
msgstr "Organize a research project"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:4
msgid "本页说明怎样把研究问题推进到实验和报告。工作台安装见 :doc:`user_guide`，具体技能与 Python 接口见 :doc:`skills`。"
msgstr ""
"This page explains how to move from a research question to experiments and reports. "
"See :doc:`user_guide` for workbench setup and :doc:`skills` for individual skills and"
" Python interfaces."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:7
msgid "协作角色"
msgstr "Collaborating roles"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:9
msgid "AgentSociety 2 将研究助手、仿真参与者与研究者连接在同一个研究工作区中：研究助手组织任务，仿真参与者产生行为响应，研究者审阅关键决策与证据。"
msgstr ""
"AgentSociety 2 brings research assistants, simulation participants, and researchers into a shared"
" workspace. The assistant coordinates tasks, participants generate behavioral responses, and "
"researchers review key decisions and evidence."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:15
msgid "角色"
msgstr "Role"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:16
msgid "在工作区中做什么"
msgstr "Work in the shared workspace"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:17
msgid "人类研究者"
msgstr "Human researcher"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:18
msgid "明确研究问题，确认假设、实验设计与结论；检查中间产物并决定如何修订。"
msgstr ""
"Define the question and confirm hypotheses, design, and conclusions; inspect "
"intermediate artifacts and decide how to revise them."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:19
msgid "AI Social Scientist"
msgstr "AI Social Scientist"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:20
msgid "通过研究技能整理文献、准备数据、配置和执行实验、分析结果并整理报告。"
msgstr ""
"Use research skills to organize literature, prepare data, configure and run "
"experiments, analyze results, and produce reports."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:21
msgid "Silicon Participants"
msgstr "Silicon Participants"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:22
msgid "仿真中的 Agent；按画像、技能与环境规则行动，留下可检查的运行记录。"
msgstr ""
"Simulation agents that act according to their profiles, skills, and environment "
"rules, leaving inspectable run records."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:25
msgid "从问题到产物"
