msgstr "Theoretical basis, testable relationships, control and treatment conditions"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/research_workflow.rst:39
msgid "``papers/``、``hypothesis_*/HYPOTHESIS.md``"
